# Mainnet operator config — TEMPLATE. Copy to secrets/mainnet.env (gitignored) and fill in.
# The real file is the single local source of truth for the DEPLOYED runtime (Fly console); it is
# never pushed to GitHub. Push it with:  NETWORK=mainnet scripts/secrets.sh push-fly
#
# Only these two values live here — they have no other home:

# Keyed 0.10.x mainnet endpoint (declare/estimate are rate-limited on public RPCs):
STARKNET_RPC=

# Generated once (openssl rand -hex 32) — the console fail-closes writes without it:
CONSOLE_ADMIN_TOKEN=

# NOT here: the operator PRIVATE KEY (lives only in sncast's accounts file, ~/.starknet_accounts/…)
# and the two addresses below — scripts/secrets.sh DERIVES them at push time from their canonical
# sources, so a redeploy can't leave a stale copy:
#   ANCHOR_CONTRACT_ADDRESS   ← deployments/mainnet.json
#   STARKNET_ACCOUNT_ADDRESS  ← sncast plc-mainnet
# (For a local `ingest` run you don't need this file at all — scripts/ingest.sh resolves everything.)
